{"3635240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saw Counter", "steam_appid": 3635240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/87f52f7c81365bc2779144890e9ab158.webp?t=1774711425\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The killer is here, and now he's coming for you!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will put you through trials, play with your emotions, your mind, and your body. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Saw Counter” is a demanding, very demanding, horror-clicker. Test your skill and your tolerance for failure in the main story mode, overcome the challenges, and uncover the truth. Or delve into endless mode and compete to achieve impossible scores within Campbell’s Meat Factory, where there’s always a challenge waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.poster.avif?t=1774711425\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.webm?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/6c13e9fd8817646e8723c5a0f4c4aade.mp4?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/963c1b507f270c950bbf3bff5fad4ab4.webp?t=1774711425\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember those horror movies where you yelled at the protagonist to scream, run, and call the police? Well… Now it's your turn to be the protagonist. Test your endurance, your mind, and your feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/04dda24554acb7561e074639607eb949.webp?t=1774711425\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story through its endings—why did the killer come for you? Why are you strapped to that chair? And why a saw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game, a short story—but just enough to keep you entertained for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.poster.avif?t=1774711425\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.webm?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/30ab890dd8fb06b95fe6d1fac82363d7.mp4?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/09df55f1ddadd5560b6fd5f2b8d01214.webp?t=1774711425\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game with a condensed but intense story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological terror mixed with clicker and horror mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree system that allows the game to become easier as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting events that occur while you try to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished, carefully crafted graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few puzzles, but enough to keep you alert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode to compete, endure, and continuously improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets throughout different parts of the game, waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.poster.avif?t=1774711425\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.webm?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/50ba3c04b5fdcb976a55e08b7a47f3f9.mp4?t=1774711425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635240/extras/87f52f7c81365bc2779144890e9ab158.webp?t=1774711425\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The killer is here, and now he's coming for you!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He will put you through trials, play with your emotions, your mind, and your body. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Saw Counter” is a demanding, very demanding, horror-clicker. Test your skill and your tolerance for failure in the main story mode, overcome the challenges, and uncover the truth. Or delve into endless mode and compete to achieve impossible scores within Campbell’s Meat Factory, where there’s always a challenge waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta